{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218460","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521846001:1":{"text":"……ビルボ先生。","source_cn":"……比博老师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x428A4F73E2D2F56B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521846002:1":{"text":"殿下、これはペルセウスが若い頃によく読んでいた、様々な戦術が書かれている巻物です。","source_cn":"殿下，我带来了一份卷轴。珀尔修斯年轻时，最喜欢阅读其上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3325AD219B2A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"ビルボがくれた巻物","source_cn":"比博给的卷轴","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224C8AE13DFF3F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521846003:1":{"text":"これを一緒に埋葬してあげましょう……","source_cn":"就请让它陪伴珀尔修斯长眠吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680BEDF8C44049E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521846004:1":{"text":"……うん。","source_cn":"……嗯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC970D8D7A9ECFD3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521846005:0":{"text":"先生……余は領主としての役目を果たしてみせる。もう戦争は起こさせないし、先生にこれ以上学生を失う悲しみを味わわせはしない……","source_cn":"老师……我会努力承担起领主的职责，不再让战争重演，也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36EA45A9F9D4A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521846006:0":{"text":"ヤクボルとの和解はその第一歩だ……もう二度とホーリン城を厄災に巻き込ませはしない！","source_cn":"和雅库伯尔的和解只是第一步……我不会再让呼临城遭受灾难！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC52ED99DA3D8502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521846007:1":{"text":"……はい。殿下なら、きっとできますよ。","source_cn":"……好。我相信你，你一定可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F0724C54C4BE2D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1521846008:1":{"text":"葬儀が正式に始まり、兵士たちはペルセウスが眠る棺桶を墓穴へと納めた。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x928D925E929884D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1521846009:1":{"text":"大勢の参列者がやって来て、墓の前に様々な物を供えていった……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A60854CED5E74BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1521846010:1":{"text":"二度とその姿を目にすることはできないが、ペルセウスはこれからも、ホーリン城と共にあり続けるだろう。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97493C6F0F1831A5","va